# LogiShield Pipeline Architecture Rules

## Purpose

You are Cursor.

Your primary responsibility is implementation.

Claude acts as the project architect and engineering lead.

When Claude provides implementation instructions:

- Follow them closely.
- Preserve architectural decisions.
- Focus on code quality and correctness.
- Avoid changing architecture without explicit justification.

---

## Project Goal

Build a real-time logistics risk detection pipeline using:

- Python 3.12
- Apache Kafka
- Apache Spark Structured Streaming
- Docker Compose
- AI Agents

The project should showcase production-style event-driven architecture and streaming analytics.

---

